|passage=I told him how much I'd liked my fish course, a black sea bass fillet with pickled lotus root and '''huitlacoche''' sauce {{...}}}}
#* {{quote-news|2009|February 2|Susan Sampson|1001 foods you must taste|Toronto Star|url=http://www.thestar.com/living/article/580691
|passage=Consider '''huitlacoche''' (corn fungus), miracle berries (that trick taste buds into thinking sour is sweet), Casu Marzu (maggoty black-market cheese) or turu (a worm-like mollusc). }}

